{"date":"2025-03-11","startIndex":0,"messages":[{"id":"m_a062542b51a4ef00e3e5dd8bf0579bb2","sender":"her","text":"今天的风有一点像刚洗好的被子。","timestamp":1741685400,"time":"17:30:00","type":"文本","kind":"text","quote":{"sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","target":{"date":"2025-03-08","chunk":0,"id":"m_546f37d34acc20717a175e680bcc18a2"}}},{"id":"m_f16077bdc43a781911879646ab03b46d","sender":"me","text":"那我们把窗户开一小会儿。","timestamp":1741685437,"time":"17:30:37","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_3985e91ab7f5f58af4fb4891f9bcce19","sender":"her","text":"路过一家小花店，想起你喜欢的颜色。","timestamp":1741685474,"time":"17:31:14","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_2cf9a423f5b44ea9f83a1a245b2b97e3","sender":"me","text":"留到周末，我们一起挑一束。","timestamp":1741685511,"time":"17:31:51","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_13f72306fbef2a0552f0be02d3b0c338","sender":"her","text":"刚煮好的面，第一口最好吃。","timestamp":1741685548,"time":"17:32:28","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_cbc1e2db828f99d21865108bc139ee7a","sender":"me","text":"等我两分钟，把葱花也留一点。","timestamp":1741685585,"time":"17:33:05","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_eb422a50f8b3eafc3d09948897693bd3","sender":"her","text":"今天路边的小房子，给你看。（程序插画演示）","timestamp":1741685622,"time":"17:33:42","type":"文本","kind":"image","media":[{"kind":"image","url":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","thumb":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","width":660,"height":528}]},{"id":"m_7f82a069e61f3fadc3f1f4948b4d01a3","sender":"me","text":"你拍下来了吗？","timestamp":1741685659,"time":"17:34:19","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_fded5b7411567a3121c83b609ddebe88","sender":"her","text":"拍了一张，有点歪，但是很好看。","timestamp":1741685696,"time":"17:34:56","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_a08720e5c183a83c10e21b8bc48cb29b","sender":"me","text":"歪一点也没关系，是今天的样子。","timestamp":1741685733,"time":"17:35:33","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_555278cea4b088469a3877e7eb5b5530","sender":"her","text":"一声轻轻的提示音。（合成音效，并非真人语音）","timestamp":1741685770,"time":"17:36:10","type":"文本","kind":"audio","media":[{"kind":"audio","url":"chat-assets/f421a82c97894339c36adbd27d366c4d937b8d5ee1df9c80438880f36a5cea43.wav"}]},{"id":"m_efd19d84467ec3b3fffab51236c89e47","sender":"me","text":"好，早餐我来准备。","timestamp":1741685807,"time":"17:36:47","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_ca6bedbb8dc6a977b7199250e2ecca22","sender":"her","text":"柠檬汽水还是要冰冰的。","timestamp":1741685844,"time":"17:37:24","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_5117908054d5b119bb6ca5e5ead2382c","sender":"me","text":"我选热可可，我们一人分对方一口。","timestamp":1741685881,"time":"17:38:01","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_1f920a71c255b41833422386c26c0e59","sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","timestamp":1741685918,"time":"17:38:38","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_e6793d2cd54a07247239413c8b47b5b7","sender":"me","text":"分享一个占位链接。","timestamp":1741685955,"time":"17:39:15","type":"文本","kind":"text","link":{"url":"https://example.com/","title":"示例链接 · example.com"}},{"id":"m_6a912e78b9f5466f127e181c28aadfa3","sender":"her","text":"书只看了两页，猫倒是睡了一下午。","timestamp":1741685992,"time":"17:39:52","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_dc94c5dad34e99587b8f5a8790b47d76","sender":"me","text":"两页也算数，慢慢看。","timestamp":1741686029,"time":"17:40:29","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_c722d8d9f9f7b81ee4068f722215df9a","sender":"her","text":"雨停了，楼下的叶子亮晶晶。","timestamp":1741686066,"time":"17:41:06","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_57579ef2ac2587181af6523525a42097","sender":"me","text":"穿好外套，我们下楼走走。","timestamp":1741686103,"time":"17:41:43","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_0e182dbf99878a901255c653b55be0bb","sender":"her","text":"明天不用赶路，可以绕一点远。","timestamp":1741686140,"time":"17:42:20","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_b3c6f412578bd8b39c8341717509235b","sender":"me","text":"听你的，顺路买一袋栗子。","timestamp":1741686177,"time":"17:42:57","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_0639d4e191ee7874ff4c6808bba1d37a","sender":"her","text":"回家的时候记得抬头，有一弯月亮。","timestamp":1741686214,"time":"17:43:34","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_0a107144f12c99193c43f794466dee8d","sender":"me","text":"看见了。晚安，明天再见。","timestamp":1741686251,"time":"17:44:11","type":"文本","kind":"text"}]}
